      "writtenOn": "2025-12-16T15:23:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello Artem, today the RadosGW service needs the ``admin`` role _or_ a custom role that allows the ``identity:ec2_get_credential`` and ``identity:s3tokens_validate`` (new since OSSA-2025-002) policies, or the `service` role (since OSSA-2025-002) for `identity:s3tokens_validate`` and a custom role for ``identity:ec2_get_credential``\n\nPlease see my mailing list post about what Keystone access RadosGW needs [1].\n\nI\u0027m open to any suggestions, I don\u0027t remember why listing is included here so I can probably narrow this down but if that\u0027s not enough what is the next step, do we add a new default role? do we leave this as a problem for operators to solve with custom roles?\n\n[1] https://marc.info/?l\u003dceph-users\u0026m\u003d176241342607057\u0026w\u003d2",
      "parentUuid": "9d904181_a41eedd1",
      "revId": "bb0745a204f7941e935dedc2bb98d0eb4f8472d1",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
    {
